{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2021-08-11 12:42:00', 'title': 'SOCALGAS RAISES GIANT SHOVEL AT ANGEL STADIUM OF ANAHEIM TO REMIND SOUTHERN CALIFORNIANS TO CONTACT 811 BEFORE DIGGING', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, AUG. 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN RECOGNITION OF NATIONAL 811 SAFE DIGGING DAY – A NATIONAL EVENT FOCUSED ON PROMOTING SAFE DIGGING PRACTICES AT THE HOME OR WORKSITE – \xa0SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA GAS CO. (SOCALGAS) RAISED A 30-FOOT-TALL REPLICA SHOVEL AT ANGEL STADIUM OF ANAHEIM. THE HOISTING OF THE SHOVEL KICKED OFF A MONTH-LONG MARKETING CAMPAIGN TO PROMOTE SAFE DIGGING PRACTICES AND EDUCATE SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA RESIDENTS ABOUT THE IMPORTANCE OF CONTACTING 811 TO HAVE BURIED UTILITIES LINES PROPERLY MARKED PRIOR TO THE START OF ANY EXCAVATION PROJECT.'}